OL,3,AUK government set to publish new
OL,4,Atreaties agreed with EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government and the EU is set to
OL,7,Fpublish the texts of two treaties on
OL,8,FThursday afternoon that were agreed
OL,9,Flast week as part of a new deal with
OL,10,Fthe EU, as well as the UK legislation
OL,11,Fto enact the bulk of the deal.
OL,13,FThe BBC understands the treaties
OL,14,Fcontain a 10-year termination clause
OL,15,Fthat would mean if one party ended the
OL,16,Fagreement in that time they would have
OL,17,Fto pay to rebuild border checks
OL,18,Finfrastructure, which will be
OL,19,Fsignificantly scaled back as part of
OL,20,Fthe new deal.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
