OL,3,AUK government set to publish new
OL,4,Atreaties agreed with EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat means that if a future government
OL,7,For the EU ended the deal, they would
OL,8,Fhave to pay potentially significant
OL,9,Fcosts to re-establish border controls.
OL,11,FOpposition leader Kemi Badenoch and
OL,12,FReform UK's Nigel Farage have suggested
OL,13,Fthey would refuse to pay.
